'''Darkness''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 6th tier in the Team Rewards during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The blade shows broken down pieces withdrawing into the darkness starting from the top, while cracks appear mid-blade to resemble more pieces about to get ripped out. 

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Darkness (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

